<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>30 Days on Anne Arundel Guide</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/tags/30-days/</link><description>Recent content in 30 Days on Anne Arundel Guide</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>en-us</language><copyright>© 2026</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://annearundelguide.com/tags/30-days/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Your First 30 Days in Anne Arundel County: Complete Checklist</title><link>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/settling-in-checklist/</link><pubDate>Wed, 20 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://annearundelguide.com/topics/settling-in-checklist/</guid><description>&lt;h1 class="relative group"&gt;Your First 30 Days in Anne Arundel County: Complete Checklist
 &lt;div id="your-first-30-days-in-anne-arundel-county-complete-checklist" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#your-first-30-days-in-anne-arundel-county-complete-checklist" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Estimated reading time: 5 minutes&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Moving to Anne Arundel County is a big step, and there&amp;rsquo;s a lot to keep track of in those first few weeks. This checklist will help you stay organized and make sure nothing falls through the cracks.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Week 1: The Essentials
 &lt;div id="week-1-the-essentials" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-1-the-essentials" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Day 1-2: Arrival &amp;amp; Basic Setup
 &lt;div id="day-1-2-arrival--basic-setup" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#day-1-2-arrival--basic-setup" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find the nearest grocery store&lt;/strong&gt; - Stock up on essentials: food, toiletries, cleaning supplies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Locate the nearest pharmacy&lt;/strong&gt; - CVS, Walgreens, or local pharmacies throughout the county&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find the nearest urgent care clinic&lt;/strong&gt; - Don&amp;rsquo;t wait until you need it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Test all home systems&lt;/strong&gt; - Turn on water, check electrical outlets, test smoke detectors&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Locate your trash and recycling pickup schedule&lt;/strong&gt; - Contact landlord or check county website&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Set up internet service&lt;/strong&gt; - Call provider, schedule installation if needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Start utility accounts&lt;/strong&gt; - Electric (AEP), gas (if needed), water/sewer (if not included in rent)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Day 3-5: Official Documentation
 &lt;div id="day-3-5-official-documentation" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#day-3-5-official-documentation" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update driver&amp;rsquo;s license address&lt;/strong&gt; - Visit Maryland MVA with required documents&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Register your vehicle&lt;/strong&gt; - Complete registration within 30 days&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update car insurance&lt;/strong&gt; - Notify your provider of new address&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Set up mail forwarding&lt;/strong&gt; - Visit USPS office or go online&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update your address with employer&lt;/strong&gt; - For payroll and tax purposes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update address with banks&lt;/strong&gt; - Credit cards, checking, savings accounts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Day 6-7: Healthcare Setup
 &lt;div id="day-6-7-healthcare-setup" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#day-6-7-healthcare-setup" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find a primary care physician&lt;/strong&gt; - Call your insurance provider for in-network options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Transfer medical records&lt;/strong&gt; - Request from previous doctor if needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Register with a local pharmacy&lt;/strong&gt; - Set up prescription transfers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find a dental office&lt;/strong&gt; - Especially important for families with children&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Locate nearest hospital&lt;/strong&gt; - Anne Arundel Medical Center or Calvert Memorial Hospital&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Week 2: Community &amp;amp; Routine
 &lt;div id="week-2-community--routine" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-2-community--routine" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Week 2 Tasks
 &lt;div id="week-2-tasks" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-2-tasks" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Register to vote&lt;/strong&gt; - Maryland resident registration available at mva.maryland.gov&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Join community social media groups&lt;/strong&gt; - Facebook groups for your specific area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find a local gym or fitness center&lt;/strong&gt; - County parks have pools and recreation facilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Identify your local library branch&lt;/strong&gt; - Free internet, computers, programs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Register children for school&lt;/strong&gt; - Contact AACPS enrollment services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find a pediatrician&lt;/strong&gt; - If you have children, this is important&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Schedule a family photo&lt;/strong&gt; - Capture your new beginning in your new home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Week 2: Building Connections
 &lt;div id="week-2-building-connections" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-2-building-connections" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Introduce yourself to neighbors&lt;/strong&gt; - Build community relationships&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find a place of worship&lt;/strong&gt; - If applicable to your beliefs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Join a recreational program&lt;/strong&gt; - County recreation has activities for all ages&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Subscribe to local newsletters&lt;/strong&gt; - County or neighborhood newsletters&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Locate emergency services&lt;/strong&gt; - Know your precinct and fire district&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Week 3: Deeper Integration
 &lt;div id="week-3-deeper-integration" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-3-deeper-integration" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Week 3 Tasks
 &lt;div id="week-3-tasks" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-3-tasks" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Explore your neighborhood&lt;/strong&gt; - Walk or drive to understand the area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find local parks and recreation areas&lt;/strong&gt; - Check the county parks map&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Identify your nearest fire station&lt;/strong&gt; - Location for emergencies and snow emergencies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Set up routine maintenance&lt;/strong&gt; - HVAC filter change, cleaning service if needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Budget review&lt;/strong&gt; - Assess your new cost of living situation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update your resume/LinkedIn&lt;/strong&gt; - Add new address for future opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Register for county programs&lt;/strong&gt; - Parks, recreation, senior services if applicable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Week 3: Financial Organization
 &lt;div id="week-3-financial-organization" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-3-financial-organization" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Review all subscriptions&lt;/strong&gt; - Cancel or transfer services as needed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Set up automatic bill payments&lt;/strong&gt; - For utilities, mortgages, loans&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update emergency contacts&lt;/strong&gt; - Local contacts, local doctor, local emergency services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Review insurance coverage&lt;/strong&gt; - Ensure it matches Maryland requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Plan your commute&lt;/strong&gt; - If working, test your commute during actual rush hour&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Research local tax benefits&lt;/strong&gt; - Maryland-specific deductions and credits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Week 4: Settling In &amp;amp; Future Planning
 &lt;div id="week-4-settling-in--future-planning" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-4-settling-in--future-planning" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Week 4 Tasks
 &lt;div id="week-4-tasks" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#week-4-tasks" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Complete your vehicle registration&lt;/strong&gt; - Make sure this is done if not already&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Schedule annual medical screenings&lt;/strong&gt; - Doctor checkups, dental cleanings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Plan a family outing&lt;/strong&gt; - Visit a local attraction together&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Update all social media profiles&lt;/strong&gt; - New location, new community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Research continuing education or professional development&lt;/strong&gt; - Maryland has opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Plan a housewarming or neighborhood gathering&lt;/strong&gt; - If you want to build community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Review and adjust your budget&lt;/strong&gt; - See how your new lifestyle is working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Making It Home
 &lt;div id="making-it-home" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#making-it-home" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Decorate to feel comfortable&lt;/strong&gt; - Add personal touches to make it feel like home&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Find your coffee shop or favorite spot&lt;/strong&gt; - Regular places build community&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Attend a community event&lt;/strong&gt; - County often hosts festivals and gatherings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Get to know local businesses&lt;/strong&gt; - Support local economy and build connections&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;input disabled="" type="checkbox"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Create your local routine&lt;/strong&gt; - Grocery shopping, gym, weekend activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

