&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Common First-Month Mistakes to Avoid
 &lt;div id="common-first-month-mistakes-to-avoid" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#common-first-month-mistakes-to-avoid" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not testing your commute during actual rush hour&lt;/strong&gt; - Test it before finalizing work arrangements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waiting too long to get vehicle registered&lt;/strong&gt; - Do it within the first two weeks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not setting up a primary care physician&lt;/strong&gt; - Do this early, appointments can take time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ignoring local traffic patterns&lt;/strong&gt; - Get to know the roads and parking situations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not joining community groups&lt;/strong&gt; - Facebook groups, neighborhood associations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Forgetting to update insurance&lt;/strong&gt; - Maryland has specific requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Not finding local services&lt;/strong&gt; - Know where the nearest hospital, pharmacy, etc. are&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

&lt;h2 class="relative group"&gt;Quick Reference: What You Need to Know
 &lt;div id="quick-reference-what-you-need-to-know" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#quick-reference-what-you-need-to-know" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
