&lt;/h2&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Vehicle Registration Fees
 &lt;div id="vehicle-registration-fees" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
 &lt;span
 class="absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none"&gt;
 &lt;a class="text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline" href="#vehicle-registration-fees" aria-label="Anchor"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
 &lt;/span&gt;
 
&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Standard passenger vehicle: $100-150&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motorcycle: $50-80&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional fees may apply based on vehicle type&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h3 class="relative group"&gt;Maryland Driver&amp;rsquo;s License
 &lt;div id="maryland-drivers-license" class="anchor"&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
 
